# Wave W17-O (Route 114): hunter post — a fossil hunter’s marker post among the craters: a post with a small ochre claim-flag tied at its head and a turned stone at its foot, marking a worked crater (design: fossil hunters turning stones along the crater road). On impact turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the marker posts by the flag: this post claims a dig, it does not point a road.
